  "body_html": "<h1>withMyersonPayment_quasiLinearUtility_eq</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma withMyersonPayment_quasiLinearUtility_eq [DecidableEq I] (x : (I → ℝ) → I → ℝ) (v b : I → ℝ) (i : I) : (withMyersonPayment x).quasiLinearUtility b v i = (v i - b i) * x b i + ∫ z in 0..b i, x (Function.update b i z) i</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>quasiLinearUtility</li>\n<li>quasiLinearValue</li>\n</ul>",
